#term-feed { position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; }
/* poster (a real, compressed still pulled from the video's own first frame) paints
   instantly and carries the same filter, so on a slow connection the CRT shows a
   frozen frame of the feed rather than a loading state — the video fades in over
